  "description": {
    "raw": "All affected creatures are veiled with a commonplace appearance. This appearance varies based on the viewer, but is always an ordinary member of that viewer’s race, ethnicity, or nationality. This familiarity grants a +2 bonus on Diplomacy checks attempted by affected targets against those not affected by the spell.\n\nCreatures with an attitude of unfriendly or hostile toward an affected target can attempt a Will save to disbelieve the effect the first time they encounter that target.",
    "search_text": "\"all affected creatures are veiled with a commonplace appearance. this appearance varies based on the viewer, but is always an ordinary member of that viewer’s race, ethnicity, or nationality. this familiarity grants a +2 bonus on diplomacy checks attempted by affected targets against those not affected by the spell.\\n\\ncreatures with an attitude of unfriendly or hostile toward an affected target can attempt a will save to disbelieve the effect the first time they encounter that target.\"",
